    static String getHardwareName() {
        try {
            Process p = Runtime.getRuntime().exec("uname -m");
            p.waitFor();

            InputStream in__ = p.getInputStream();
            try {
                return readFully(in__);
            } finally {
                in__.close();
            }
        } catch (Throwable e) {
            System.err.println("Error while running uname -m: " + e.getMessage());
            return "unknown";
        }
    }
```

